                        what was left. That job doesn't count as a mow (angle_increment, duration). armed: s it still is
  planner.simulate      the plan of planner.plan (its params: area_id or outline, settings...) driven by a simulated
                        mower (mowbite_sim.simulate: OpenMower's FTC controller and mower_logic, the drive,
                        xbot_positioning, each a bit off like on a real mower): {model (a preset: realistic, the
                        default, ideal, omsim, or {preset, name: value, ...}: MowerModel's values; this mower's FTC
