                        looks, worst}, nav_errors: [[x, y]] where FTC gave up, aborted, tracking: {kind: {p50, p95,
                        max}} m off the plan, spins}. Answered on a thread of its own (it takes a while), one at a
                        time (another meanwhile: an error)
  planner.simulate.status  how far the one running got: {running, area_id, phase (planning, simulating,
                        evaluating), fraction (0..1 of all of it), elapsed_s}; running false: the last one's
  planner.simulate.cancel  ends the one running ({cancelled: whether one was}), its planner.simulate answers with the
                        error "cancelled"
  planner.area.set      an area's own settings or an obstacle's own margin, written into OpenMower's map (its
