                        OPENMOWER_PROPS)}, margin: m (obstacles and areas to keep out of, null: gone)}, gives {area_id,
                        properties}. The whole map goes back as the node got it last, only that area changed (whoever
                        writes the map last wins: an app editing the map meanwhile puts its own back)
